-- statement:
--   This bundle defines the fixed ordered array `sourceLeafBlock16` of $1000$ pairs $(g,s)$ of a natural number and a finite Unicode string, by concatenating its private literal subarrays numbered $64$ through $67$ in that order. Each of its $4$ literal subarrays contains $250$ entries. Concatenation preserves every listed entry and its order and performs no sorting or deduplication. The declaration has no parameters or hypotheses and defines data rather than a proposition. It asserts no decoding success, graph correspondence, geometric realization, feasibility, infeasibility or certificate correctness; it supplies no proof or lookup default.
